      "title": "Front-End & Multi-Locale Directory",
      "items": [
        "Astro v5 ultra-fast static directory with Neo-Brutalist stickers and 3D Pepe mascot",
        "Multi-language support across 15 global locales (en, es, hi, ja, de, fr, zh, etc.)",
        "Interactive search, random site exploration, and categorized curated collections"
