        "Strict Clerk backend token verification ensures user_id cannot be spoofed by client",
        "Isolated iframe sandboxing (sandbox='' and pointer-events: none) prevents clickjacking",
        "Input sanitization and URL protocol validation strictly block malicious URI schemes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "InstaFlow Administrative Workflows",
      "items": [
        "Centralized review queue: 1-click Approve, Publish to live directory, or Reject with feedback",
